# FINAL LOCKED DASHBOARD — DO NOT MODIFY WITHOUT EXPLICIT USER APPROVAL

The Dashboard is an approved, frozen baseline (premium crystal-glass cinematic ERP dashboard). Do not change, redesign, restyle, restyle-via-globals, add, remove, resize, or reposition anything on it unless the user explicitly requests that specific Dashboard change in the current conversation.

This lock is independent of the Login Page lock. Both remain fully in force.

## Before editing any file below

Require an explicit user instruction that clearly asks to modify the Dashboard (for example: “change the Dashboard KPI glow” or “update Dashboard typography”). Unrelated work, other modules, refactors, “while we’re here” polish, and inferred improvements are not approval.

